-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;font-weight: bolder;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.5px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="muz9hp531kuc" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">刚刚，Anthropic 发布了 Claude Haiku 5.5。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这次升级的幅度不小，尤其是在计算机操作方面，OSWorld 2.1 评测成绩从上一代的 15.7% 提升到了 72.4%。知识工作和复杂推理能力也有明显改善，而按照 Anthropic 公布的数据，新模型的平均运行成本还下降了约 75%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">除此之外，Haiku 5.5 还加入了自适应推理机制，并支持 100 万 Token 上下文。过去，Haiku 主要用来处理摘要、分类、信息提取这些高频任务，优势一直是速度快、成本低。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e909f2d2-5aed-4ce8-b3f6-1e60e7786775&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1144,&quot;width&quot;:1198,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1144,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1198,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1144,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1198,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRSuEbm8e8oZ7Ulxoc8ecmYCQnIh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RSuEbm8e8oZ7Ulxoc8ecmYCQnIh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:157895,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e2e4c3.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9549248747913188" data-type="png" data-w="1198" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1198" data-height="1144" data-backw="546" data-backh="521" data-imgfileid="100263035" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e2e4c3.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这次更新后，它能处理的工作明显复杂了不少，部分评测成绩甚至已经接近 Sonnet 5.5。不过，换到复杂编程任务，两者的差距依然明显。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">再看这次更新的推理机制和价格规则，Haiku 5.5 在不同任务中的表现与实际使用成本，其实还有不少细节需要拆开来看。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="muz9jlqg216p"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e69768.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e69768.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">复杂编程仍有差距</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Haiku 5.5 的性能增长主要体现在计算机操作、知识工作和多学科推理几个方向，其中计算机操作的变化尤其明显。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在 OSWorld 2.1 离线子集上，Haiku 5.5 取得 72.4%，上一代只有 15.7%，Sonnet 5.5 则达到 83.9%。OSWorld 测试的是模型通过计算机界面完成长链路任务的能力，涉及界面理解、操作执行以及根据环境反馈继续完成任务。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">与普通文本问答相比，计算机操作存在更多状态依赖。模型完成一次点击或者输入后，页面可能发生变化，后续动作需要根据新的界面状态决定。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;48283c15-702b-4987-b170-110f93900585&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1066,&quot;width&quot;:1498,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1066,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1498,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1066,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1498,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQ73EbR9h3o5ZdQxJfznctqgynme%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Q73EbR9h3o5ZdQxJfznctqgynme&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:167967,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e99233.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7116154873164219" data-type="png" data-w="1498" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1498" data-height="1066" data-backw="546" data-backh="389" data-imgfileid="100263031" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88e99233.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果操作失败，模型还要判断当前环境是否仍然符合任务要求。Haiku 5.5 在这一评测中的增长，说明它处理连续操作任务的能力相比上一代有了明显改善。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">但 72.4% 对应的是特定测试集中的完成率，不能直接代表所有浏览器或桌面任务的实际成功率。真实业务中的动态页面、权限限制和异常状态，仍然需要在对应环境中单独测试。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">知识工作方面，Haiku 5.5 在 GDPval-AA v2.1 上获得 1620 分，Haiku 4.5 为 735 分，Sonnet 5.5 为 1840 分。该评测涵盖 44 类职业的实际工作任务，涉及材料分析、信息整合和工作成果生成。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;03d40fcf-6db3-4d94-a180-e4ffff35b053&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1064,&quot;width&quot;:1446,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1064,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1446,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1064,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1446,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FB795bMtAPoSBxOxYAeLcnGjGnUb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;B795bMtAPoSBxOxYAeLcnGjGnUb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:127332,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88ebe6b5.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.73582295988935" data-type="png" data-w="1446" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1446" data-height="1064" data-backw="546" data-backh="402" data-imgfileid="100263032" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88ebe6b5.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">另一项 AA-Briefcase v1.1 评测中，Haiku 5.5 从上一代的 614 分提高至 1578 分。多学科推理测试 Humanity&#39;s Last Exam 的无工具成绩达到 45.9%，接入工具后为 57.4%，也明显高于上一代。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这些评测涉及的任务比普通信息提取更加复杂。模型需要理解多个信息来源之间的关系，处理材料中的限制条件，并根据已有内容形成结果。工具的引入还增加了信息获取和结果整合的环节。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">不过，编程评测呈现出不同的情况。在 FrontierCode 1.1 主测试中，Haiku 5.5 得分为 46.4%，与 Sonnet 5.5 的 52.1% 差距较小。但在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 中，Haiku 5.5 得分为 39.2%，Sonnet 5.5 达到 70.6%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;baac0ff6-c0af-47ef-a0a0-5c788ea10a4e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1058,&quot;width&quot;:1432,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1058,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1432,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1058,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1432,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYB0Ib1VVtozEA9xqEi9cTCK8nC0%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YB0Ib1VVtozEA9xqEi9cTCK8nC0&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:145686,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88eef86c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7388268156424581" data-type="png" data-w="1432" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1432" data-height="1058" data-backw="546" data-backh="403" data-imgfileid="100263034" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88eef86c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Terminal-Bench 涉及命令行环境下的复杂多步骤任务，模型通常需要读取文件、执行命令、处理错误并根据测试反馈调整操作。它对持续规划和执行状态维护的要求较高。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 也在发布材料中明确指出，Sonnet 5.5 和 Opus 5.5 仍然更适合复杂智能体编程任务，Haiku 5.5 则主要面向范围明确的子任务、摘要和上下文压缩等工作。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">企业早期测试提供了更多具体数据。Asana 报告，在 AI Teammates 相关测试中，Haiku 5.5 的任务完成延迟相比其现用模型降低超过 30%，单轮推理速度提高至多 2.5 倍。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1437d70c-abf5-45f2-9c61-4f2ca77b09a4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:546,&quot;width&quot;:1052,&quot;currHeight&quot;:546,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1052,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:546,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1052,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKqlYbi2a7oOD8fxj8Jxcq01Hnac%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KqlYbi2a7oOD8fxj8Jxcq01Hnac&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:116043,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f298b8.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5190114068441065" data-type="png" data-w="1052" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1052" data-height="546" data-backw="546" data-backh="283" data-imgfileid="100263033" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f298b8.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">HubSpot 在模拟 CRM 环境中，测得三次运行平均 92.8% 的成绩，AlphaSense 则在 400 次文档问答测试中，测得 Haiku 5.5 的得分为 0.84，上一代为 0.76。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这些结果来自不同企业的内部测试，各自采用不同的任务与评估标准，适合用于了解特定业务场景中的表现，无法直接作为统一的模型能力排名。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f5d6c459-2a2b-47d2-a0a6-dbbdff36b760&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:578,&quot;width&quot;:1052,&quot;currHeight&quot;:578,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1052,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:578,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1052,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJ6EjbACXIonH06xz6zscgWzVneg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;J6EjbACXIonH06xz6zscgWzVneg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:121210,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f4e691.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5494296577946768" data-type="png" data-w="1052" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1052" data-height="578" data-backw="546" data-backh="300" data-imgfileid="100263038" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f4e691.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="muz9kdimcoe"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f815bd.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88f815bd.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">自适应推理加入 Haiku</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">除了性能变化，Haiku 5.5 还成为首个支持可调节推理强度的 Haiku 模型。雷峰网</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">此前 Haiku 4.5 使用扩展思考功能时，开发者需要提前设置固定的内部推理预算。无论任务是简单的信息查找，还是涉及多个条件的复杂分析，模型可以使用的推理空间都受到预先设置的数值限制。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Haiku 5.5 改用 Adaptive Thinking。模型能够根据任务内容决定是否使用内部推理以及投入多少计算，开发者则通过 Effort 设置整体推理强度。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b7d2a969-17ca-472c-9548-8881cbc17517&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1072,&quot;width&quot;:1454,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1072,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1454,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1072,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1454,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZPMPbNrQKoYbAlxlyPNcR12rnRf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZPMPbNrQKoYbAlxlyPNcR12rnRf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:112061,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88fa9da8.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7372764786795049" data-type="png" data-w="1454" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1454" data-height="1072" data-backw="546" data-backh="403" data-imgfileid="100263039" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88fa9da8.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">例如，提取文档中的日期通常不需要长时间分析，而比较多个合同版本之间的条款差异，需要同时处理更多条件和相互关联的信息。自适应推理允许模型在这两类任务中采用不同的计算投入。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这一机制也涉及推理时计算资源的分配。对于复杂任务，增加内部推理可以让模型处理更多中间步骤，但更长的推理过程也会增加 Token 消耗和响应时间。对于简单任务，减少内部推理能够降低不必要的计算开销。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 在发布页面展示了不同推理强度下，Haiku 5.5 在 OSWorld、GDPval-AA 和 Humanity&#39;s Last Exam 中的成本与性能关系。不过，不同任务对额外推理计算的反应并不一致，不能把提高推理档位直接等同于固定幅度的性能提升。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;403ae79b-d8c4-4b48-a525-784353d81418&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1074,&quot;width&quot;:1450,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1074,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1450,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1074,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1450,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPvSsb0lBoomqHbxtdexcNTzQnnf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;PvSsb0lBoomqHbxtdexcNTzQnnf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:125452,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88fd407a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7406896551724138" data-type="png" data-w="1450" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1450" data-height="1074" data-backw="546" data-backh="404" data-imgfileid="100263040" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b88fd407a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">API 层面也有几项需要处理的变化。首先，Haiku 5.5 不再沿用上一代手动指定固定思考 Token 数量的方式，旧有的推理配置需要调整。其次，内部推理会占用模型的输出 Token 预算。如果原有程序只根据最终答案长度设置输出上限，升级后可能出现内部推理占用了过多空间，导致正文无法完整生成的情况。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">另外，启用自适应推理后，模型响应可能包含独立的思考数据块。应用需要正确区分内部推理内容和最终输出，不能继续假设返回内容的开头一定是答案。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对于持续使用工具的智能体，推理数据与对话历史之间还存在一致性要求。开发者如果在后续请求中修改了已有的历史消息，可能影响原有推理状态的有效性。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Haiku 5.5 对部分采样参数也增加了限制，原先依靠这些参数调整输出行为的应用，需要检查接口兼容性。这些变化主要影响已经使用 Haiku 4.5 扩展思考功能的项目。迁移时除了替换模型版本，还需要重新检查推理预算、响应解析和多轮消息处理方式。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="muz9lpco1dy"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89010740.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89010740.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">百万上下文没有统一低价</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Haiku 5.5 支持 100 万 Token 上下文和 12.8 万 Token 输出，能够处理较长的文档、大型代码内容以及持续运行的工具记录。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">不过，Anthropic 没有为整个上下文窗口设置统一的低价。对于不超过 10 万 Token 的提示词，每百万输入 Token 收费 0.10 美元，每百万输出 Token 收费 0.50 美元。当提示词超过 10 万 Token 后，输入价格提高至 0.50 美元，输出价格提高至 2.50 美元。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;130e251e-1977-4b63-bf2d-36aa61f0bf40&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:446,&quot;width&quot;:1050,&quot;currHeight&quot;:446,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1050,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:446,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1050,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSu0cbvfThoI8CJxyen7c9kKEnWh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Su0cbvfThoI8CJxyen7c9kKEnWh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:52068,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89034305.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4247619047619048" data-type="png" data-w="1050" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1050" data-height="446" data-backw="546" data-backh="232" data-imgfileid="100263036" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89034305.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">缓存费用也采用分层方式。较短提示词的每百万 Token 缓存读取价格为 0.01 美元，较长提示词为 0.05 美元。相比重复传入完整内容，缓存适合复用系统指令、工具定义和公共资料。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 表示，Haiku 4.5 约 90% 的请求长度位于 10 万 Token 以内。这部分请求在新定价下获得了较大的价格降幅，但实际成本还受到 Token 使用量变化的影响。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Haiku 5.5 更新了分词器，相同内容对应的 Token 数量可能与上一代不同。因此，即使输入文本没有变化，升级后的实际计费数量也可能发生变化，需要重新测量。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对于长时间运行的智能体，上下文管理会进一步影响成本。例如，一个编程任务可能连续产生文件检索结果、代码分析记录和测试日志。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">如果每次调用都携带完整历史，输入长度会随着任务推进持续增加。Prompt Caching 可以降低重复内容的读取费用，而 Compaction 可以将已经完成的操作整理成更短的任务状态，减少后续调用需要处理的历史信息。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f665af1b-d3b3-4b18-b689-b0c7d6454b6b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:474,&quot;width&quot;:1074,&quot;currHeight&quot;:474,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1074,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:474,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1074,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUnYZbquq3oX5QLxb2dzcfDkunzc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UnYZbquq3oX5QLxb2dzcfDkunzc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:81645,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b8905bb39.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.441340782122905" data-type="png" data-w="1074" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1074" data-height="474" data-backw="546" data-backh="241" data-imgfileid="100263037" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b8905bb39.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 在发布材料中将上下文压缩列为 Haiku 5.5 的主要应用场景之一。具体部署方面，Rogo 报告了使用 Haiku 子智能体从企业 10-K 文件中提取收入数据的案例，由更大的模型负责后续演示文稿制作。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Cognition 则将 Haiku 5.5 用作 Devin Fusion 的辅助模型，在 Opus 5.5 主导的配置下，FrontierCode 得分达到 66.2%，并报告成本与延迟有所下降。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这些案例采用了不同模型处理不同任务的方式，但发布材料没有提供完整的调用次数、Token 分布和成本明细，因此无法据此计算一般业务采用相同架构后的节省幅度。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;88fc35a4-97a0-48f4-8ed4-b5eaff7c190f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:508,&quot;width&quot;:1056,&quot;currHeight&quot;:508,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1056,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:508,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1056,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAVaEb0owAoCZtUxcySfcMOVxnRb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AVaEb0owAoCZtUxcySfcMOVxnRb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:90623,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89084ee1.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4810606060606061" data-type="png" data-w="1056" style="background-color:transparent;width:100%;" data-width="1056" data-height="508" data-backw="546" data-backh="263" data-imgfileid="100263041" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b89084ee1.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">此次 Anthropic 还将 Sonnet 5.5 的缓存读取价格降低 50%，从每百万 Token 0.20 美元调整为 0.10 美元。按照 Anthropic 的统计，这使 Sonnet 5.5 在多数智能体任务中的运行成本下降约 20%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这一调整仅涉及缓存读取费用，输入和输出 Token 的标准价格并未同步按相同比例下降。</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="muz9mb331y4g"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b890b6fb1.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b890b6fb1.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">迁移仍要检查实际任务表现</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Claude Haiku 5.5 已经通过 Claude API、AWS、Google Cloud 和 Microsoft Azure 等平台提供，Anthropic 同时开始更新 Python 和 TypeScript SDK，为计算机操作与浏览器操作增加测试版支持。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">从目前公布的数据看，Haiku 5.5 在计算机操作、知识工作和多学科推理评测中的成绩明显高于上一代，但复杂终端编程仍与 Sonnet 5.5 存在较大差距。价格方面，较短提示词能够获得更明显的成本优势，超过 10 万 Token 后则适用另一档收费标准。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">对于已有的 Haiku 4.5 应用，迁移涉及推理配置、Token 计算和响应解析等具体修改。如果原来使用 Sonnet 处理部分高频任务，也可以依据相同测试集比较 Haiku 5.5 的完成率、响应时间和调用费用。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Anthropic 已经给出了模型能力、接口变化和定价信息，但实际业务中的成本改善仍需要通过对应工作负载验证。尤其在多轮工具调用场景中，模型单次请求的价格、任务失败后的重试次数以及上下文增长情况，需要放在同一次完整任务中核算。</span></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b890da151.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/cNFA8C0uVPtkbNicD8I2GvtPB7zOabgtL47FMpic1WWjHrvb7HCcxSsia7AQvQhsfvGnZ9dKYlozpP4W6j20sV2wQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100236545" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b890da151.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mpzpilb31bbr"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;" data-mpa-action-id="mp0lz1ofco1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;width: 677px;transform: rotate(0deg);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;width: 50px;height: 4px;background-color: rgb(68, 153, 231);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;" mpa-from-tpl="t"></svg></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: -4px;padding: 10px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" mpa-is-content="t"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">上车，带你看遍全球 AI 顶会精华</span></span></strong></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg2nab13jb"></span></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 8px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">可独家畅览：</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">专家演讲PPT</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">大会报告全文</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b8911e574.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafMqpEPibJ4AOibc6RBL778iaiciaVgquCMrS14ia0XmXfw3YAU5iaSJzBYQOBMNGlM0ic387w7rB6QnU0PO9KPyGqXc8vu6ib2OlB3QIIIQ/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100262550" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac7b8911e574.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: cente