<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 11:18:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>IROS 2026大奖揭晓：长期记忆拿下最佳论文，人形机器人打网球、端托盘双双获奖</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/private/VYRZFCnadDOcPDeX.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px;line-height: 1.75em;display: block;" data-mpa-action-id="mmiwq6ij1i3r" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac70407b0a3e.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.55" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;display:inline-block;text-align:center;background-color:transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafMmAb9PkuKQLBiczNiaz4gL2vQ3ynZibibE3mibsibqCq4yvrcj5zaUIrCWs62RSpE3fHltyL0YyyKhjzQApicF3EUVOXfoSIIXIXibp0U/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="300" data-imgfileid="100262988" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261008/6ac70407b0a3e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-data-temp-type="image" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mmix4tgk1t7p" data-pm-slice="5 10 []" style="padding-left: 16px;padding-right: 16px;"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;padding-left: 0px;padding-right: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="width: 100%;background: rgb(246, 248, 255);padding: 20px 0px 12px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mm0fhbur236d" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;"><section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 0px 16px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span data-mpa-action-id="mmix6wyl1l05" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: bold">在机器人领域，一个更大的模型并不能自动解决所有问题。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgbkegzw9n"></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mpmlbwxl8oz"></span><span data-lark-record-data="{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZeduLh9ohPKcxr1VDcCN8nnRh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;具身智能，攻入油烟弥漫的后厨&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+e&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7629541120642091970&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:false,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;cfb07fd4-9966-4c79-8ea8-e8bc041d3659&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:7,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:3,&quot;end&quot;:17},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;BnkadAUsgo3AbGx4g5hcavcRn7g&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}" data-lark-record-format="docx/text"></span><span data-lark-record-data="{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;M0lkd1gU4oXvBbxr0hUcNKhwn6c&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;百万流量下的机器人打工记&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+c&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7629541120642091970&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:false,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;80c4c2a6-c274-411e-9a10-ddcaa7bcf44b&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:4,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:6,&quot;end&quot;:18},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;A5vjdZwQCor3L2xjL5CcBMFTnFh&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}" data-lark-record-format="docx/text"></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mottit0p1adr"></span><span data-lark-record-data="{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;HiT6dR6bqoegBFxS6Ztci0eLn5e&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;前Covariant AI 副总裁、舟谱数据CTO慕巍博士出任「枢途科技」CTO。&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+15&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7538706056718925852&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:false,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;dfd888fd-3d05-41de-99ef-9e50f4d1eda1&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:37,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:3,&quot;end&quot;:44},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;HCUjdyERwog1txxNzqYcmirnnBh&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}" data-lark-record-format="docx/text"></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mnzfe1dlmiz"></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mn32l2a062f"></span><span data-mpa-action-id="mmos90171jtf"></span><span data-lark-record-data="{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;AzjmduHCvoPVEexzmhKc7S4Enkg&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;联创团队刚刚亮相，这家物理AI创业公司的融资与股东阵容也随之浮出水面。&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+z&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7536161670281445404&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlock